flowchart TB
    accTitle: Melder core and advanced planes
    accDescr: The core dependency graph runtime remains central. Nexus and Rift provide mediated access, Crystallizer records and restores structural state, and MutationResearch organizes version and composition history. External storage remains optional and caller supplied.

    core["Core Dependency Graph Runtime\nAether · Frame · Spellbook · Conduit · Meld"]

    subgraph planes["Optional advanced planes"]
        direction LR
        access["Nexus + Rift\nviewer · workstation · command · codegen"]
        continuity["Crystallizer\nrecord · checkpoint · restore"]
        research["MutationResearch\nlanes · history · diff · impact · preview"]
    end

    storage[("Caller-owned storage")]
    operator["Tool / orchestrator / agent"]

    core -->|"publishes bounded live truth"| access
    core -->|"emits structural twins"| continuity
    core -->|"declares world entries"| research
    operator -->|"enters a configured room"| access
    continuity -.->|"stores detached records"| storage
    research -.->|"records composition twin"| continuity

    classDef core fill:#e8f0ff,stroke:#315a99,color:#10213d,stroke-width:2px
    classDef plane fill:#eaf7ef,stroke:#3f7a56,color:#153824
    classDef external fill:#fff4dc,stroke:#9a6b12,color:#452d00
    class core core
    class access,continuity,research plane
    class storage,operator external
